        "update_pyramid.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies whether the LAS dataset pyramid will be updated after the class codes are modified.</p><ul><li>Checked—The LAS dataset pyramid will be updated. This is the default.</li><li>Unchecked—The LAS dataset pyramid will not be updated.</li></ul></xdoc>",
